{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["Which volunteer roles do you have, and which ones need a check before someone starts?","What background check is required where you are, and who pays for it?","Do you accept volunteers under 18, and for which roles?","Where do volunteers read your agreement and safeguarding policy before agreeing?"],"howToUseResponses":"Filter by availability and role to build the rota, then check the gaps: drivers without insurance cover and people-facing volunteers without a current check can't start until that's sorted, so contact them first. Keep under-18s on roles that suit them and have a guardian's number on file. Export the list to CSV for your rota or contact sheet.","customizeSteps":["Rename the roles to the ones your organisation has, and route any role with its own requirement to a follow-up like driving.","Change the background check question to name the check used where you are, and link your agreement in the consent text.","Share the link in your newsletter and social posts, or embed it on your volunteer page."],"faqs":[{"q":"What should a volunteer sign up form include?","a":"Contact details, availability, how often they can help, the roles they're interested in, any checks those roles need, an emergency contact and agreement to your policies."},{"q":"Can volunteers under 18 sign up?","a":"Yes. Anyone who says they're under 18 is asked for a parent or guardian's contact before continuing."},{"q":"How do I collect background check information from volunteers?","a":"Ask only the volunteers whose role needs it. This form asks about checks when someone chooses to work with people directly."},{"q":"How do I turn sign-ups into a rota?","a":"Availability and roles are fixed choices, so you can filter responses in the dashboard or export them to CSV and sort them into shifts."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":10,"title":"Volunteer signup","description":"Match volunteers to shifts they can actually make.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_voluntee00","ref":"welcome","title":"Thanks for offering to help! Tell us when you're free and what you'd like to do.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_voluntee01","ref":"contact","title":"First, your details","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"contact_info","fields":["first_name","last_name","email","phone"]},{"id":"blk_voluntee02","ref":"over_18","title":"Are you 18 or over?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"yes_no","yesLabel":"Yes","noLabel":"No"},{"id":"blk_voluntee03","ref":"guardian_contact","title":"A parent or guardian's name and phone number","description":"We need this before you can be put on a shift.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":160},{"id":"blk_voluntee04","ref":"availability","title":"When are you usually free?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"multi_select","options":[{"id":"opt_weekday_mornings","label":"Weekday mornings","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_weekday_afternoons","label":"Weekday afternoons","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_weekday_evenings","label":"Weekday evenings","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_saturdays","label":"Saturdays","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_sundays","label":"Sundays","image_key":null}],"minSelections":1,"maxSelections":5,"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_voluntee05","ref":"commitment","title":"How often could you help?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_every_week","label":"Every week","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_a_couple_of","label":"A couple of times a month","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_now_and_then","label":"Now and then","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_one_off_events","label":"One-off events only","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_voluntee06","ref":"primary_role","title":"What would you most like to help with?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_driving_and_deliveries","label":"Driving and deliveries","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_working_with_people","label":"Working with people directly","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_events_and_stewarding","label":"Events and stewarding","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_fundraising","label":"Fundraising","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_admin_and_data","label":"Admin and data","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_whatever_s_needed","label":"Whatever's needed","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_voluntee07","ref":"licence_years","title":"How many years have you held a full driving licence?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"number","unique":false,"min":0,"max":80,"integerOnly":true},{"id":"blk_voluntee08","ref":"own_vehicle","title":"Would you use your own vehicle?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"yes_no","yesLabel":"Yes, my own","noLabel":"I'd need one of yours"},{"id":"blk_voluntee09","ref":"insurance","title":"Does your vehicle insurance cover volunteer driving?","description":"If you're not sure, say no and we'll help you check with your insurer.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"yes_no","yesLabel":"Yes","noLabel":"No"},{"id":"blk_voluntee10","ref":"background_check","title":"Do you have a current background check for working with children or vulnerable adults?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_yes_and_it","label":"Yes, and it's up to date","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_yes_but_it","label":"Yes, but it may have expired","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_no_i_d","label":"No, I'd need one","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_m_not","label":"I'm not sure","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_voluntee11","ref":"people_experience","title":"Have you done anything like this before?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_voluntee12","ref":"skills","title":"Any skills or experience we should know about?","description":"Languages, first aid, cooking, a trade, anything you think might help.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_voluntee13","ref":"access_needs","title":"Anything we should know to make volunteering work for you?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":600,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_voluntee14","ref":"emergency_contact","title":"An emergency contact: name and phone number","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":160},{"id":"blk_voluntee15","ref":"policies","title":"Volunteer agreement","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"legal_consent","consentText":"I have read the volunteer agreement and safeguarding policy, and agree to follow them.","allowDecline":false,"agreeLabel":"I agree","declineLabel":"I do not agree"}],"endings":[{"id":"end_voluntee01","ref":"end_thanks","title":"Welcome to the team 💚","bodyMd":"A coordinator will be in touch with the rota and your first shift.","imageUrl":null,"redirectDelaySec":4,"showSummary":false,"kind":"success","requirements":[]}],"endingRules":[],"logic":[{"id":"rl_voluntee01","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[],"groups":[]},"from":"insurance","